        "original_id": "80f0c101-fe2c-563a-97d2-3bc3d6c9d8e1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Charles Cutler\n- Events: Terre Haute prison experiments, Tuskegee syphilis study\n- Places: Terre Haute, Indiana; Alabama\n- Topics: syphilis research, unethical human experimentation\n\nFacts:\n- John Charles Cutler conducted the Terre Haute prison experiments in Terre Haute, Indiana.\n- John Charles Cutler was involved in the Tuskegee syphilis study observing the natural progression of untreated syphilis in rural African-American men in Alabama.\n- The Terre Haute prison experiments and the Tuskegee syphilis study are examples of unethical human experimentation related to syphilis research.",
